$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture The Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet		: <f0> Naboo" @
         "\n<f1>Weather		: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of day	: <f0> Night" @
         "\n<f1>Teams		: <f0> 2" @
	   "\n\n<f1>Briefing	: <f0> The Trade Federation and the Naboo Security Council are at it again on the hills of Naboo. There are two Missle Defence Buildings which can be captured for your team. This battle takes place 40 years before the Battle of Yavin. Capture the flag and the bases to add up to 10 points, to win the game.                -XGN Darth Maul.";


